{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38942","headline":"题汪氏茅亭 · 杜荀鹤","name":"题汪氏茅亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"茅亭客到多称奇，茅亭之上难题诗。\n出尘景物不可状，小手篇章徒尔爲。\n牛畔稻苗新雨後，鹤边松韵晚风时。\n君今酷爱人间事，争得安闲老在兹。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜荀鹤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38942.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38942","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}